msgstr "Avant de commencer ce tutoriel, assure-toi d'avoir installé les éléments suivants :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit SDK v2.0 or later, with [visualization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) support\n"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK v2.0 ou ultérieur, avec le support de [visualisation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`) v0.22 or later\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`) v0.22 ou ultérieur\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit IBM Transpiler with AI local mode (`pip install 'qiskit-ibm-transpiler[ai-local-mode]'`)\n"
msgstr "Qiskit IBM Transpiler avec le mode local IA (`pip install 'qiskit-ibm-transpiler[ai-local-mode]'`)\n"

